  and then invoke the fragment to emit the shared rubric + trailer:

      ## Set priority by intervention urgency (final step)

      <prompt-specific preamble sentence(s) ending with "In general:">

      {{ template "_shared/support/priority-rubric" . }}

  Whitespace contract identical to the other support fragments:
